      "side": 1,
      "message": "We need to handle all of the cases below:\n\n1. `SK_CODEC_ENCODES_PNG_WITH_RUST` - we need to handle this to avoid breaking Chromium which sets ``SK_CODEC_ENCODES_PNG_WITH_RUST` and doesn\u0027t set `SK_CODEC_ENCODES_PNG_WITH_LIBPNG` (see Chrmium\u0027s [`//skia/BUILD.gn`](https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:skia/BUILD.gn;l\u003d174-178;drc\u003dfdf57158bbb3afb17ab22231db492d4e4df556b3)\n2. `SK_CODEC_ENCODES_PNG_WITH_LIBPNG` - in case some Skia clients are like Chromium before https://crrev.com/c/7032719\n3. No `SK_CODEC_ENCODES_PNG...` - in case some Skia clients use configuration predating https://review.skia.org/926096\n\nI think that to minimize risk we need to assume that Android and/or Flutter may be in the 2nd or 3rd category.",
